\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 **Starforged Consortium**\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The Starforged Consortium is a smaller, but highly esteemed group in The Convergence known for their living construct shipbuilding and comprehensive education system. Though their services cater to a relatively limited audience, the Consortium's distinctive offerings have earned them substantial renown and respect.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Starforged Consortium Constructs** is the shipbuilding division of the Consortium, specialized in the creation of living construct ships. These unique vessels range in composition from traditional wood and metal to more exotic elements, each imbued with a sentient elemental entity. These elementals serve as the ship's soul, systems operator, and more. The Consortium itself does not sell these ships. Instead, they may occasionally trade or reward them to a select few individuals who have earned the Consortium's favor. These gifted ships can find their way into the wider Convergence through secondary owners, who may choose to auction them off. These high-stakes auctions, attended by the extremely wealthy, are the primary avenue through which outsiders can acquire one of these prized vessels. In addition, a ship's soul can be transferred into a container of sorts, encapsulated via a Starforge, should the ship be damaged beyond repair.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Starforged Consortium Seeds** is the division responsible for the seed bank and seed production, including the cultivation of materials required for the living constructs. Furthermore, this division takes the vital responsibility of creating and training the elemental entities to be tethered to the ships. These elementals, being irreplaceable individuals, are treated with utmost care, and the loss of a ship and its elemental is taken very seriously.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Starforged Consortium Systems** mirrors the role of Starforged Consortium Seeds, focusing on the production of non-organic components needed for the living constructs. They collaborate closely with Seeds to create the unique blend of organic and inorganic materials characteristic of the Consortium's ships.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Starforged Consortium Schools** is the educational division of the Consortium. This arm is responsible for the training of the Consortium's shipbuilders and personnel, as well as the employees of the Seeds and Systems divisions. They ensure that each member of the Consortium is expertly trained and skilled in their specific role, maintaining the exceptional quality of the Consortium's offerings.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The Starforged Consortium, through its dedication to craftsmanship and education, stands as a beacon of excellence within The Convergence. Their living construct ships and well-trained personnel are a testament to their commitment to quality, innovation, and the preservation of individuality.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The Entry Test is a true trial by fire, a gauntlet designed to test every facet of an individual's physical and mental capabilities. It's a lethal examination, one that has claimed the lives of many aspirants who underestimated its severity. Yet, for those who survive and succeed, it becomes a badge of honor and the gateway to a world of unprecedented opportunities. \
\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The Entry Test is blind to social influence, wealth, or lineage. All that matters is skill, determination, and the will to survive. This ruthless meritocracy has resulted in a Consortium composed of individuals who are not just the cream of the crop, but have also proven their mettle in the harshest conditions.\cb1 \
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The details of the test are a closely guarded secret, known only to those who have already undergone it. Even the location of the test changes each time it is administered, ensuring that no candidate can gain an unfair advantage by preparing in advance for the specific challenges they will face.\
\
However, some common elements of the test have been rumored. Physical endurance, mental acuity, problem-solving, and combat skills are all said to be tested to their extremes. In addition, candidates are often put in situations where they must make morally challenging decisions, testing their character and ethical compass.\
\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Surviving the Entry Test is not a guarantee of entry into the Consortium. Only those who excel across all areas and demonstrate exceptional potential are offered a place within this elite group.\
\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The high mortality rate and rigorous standards of the Entry Test have resulted in the Starforged Consortium being a relatively small group. However, this has not diluted its influence or prestige. On the contrary, each member of the Consortium is viewed as a paragon of their respective field, commanding respect and admiration across The Convergence.\
\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The Starforged Consortium Entry Test serves as a stark reminder that in The Convergence, power does not always come from wealth or influence. Sometimes, it comes from the courage to face adversity, the will to survive, and the skill to overcome.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
